-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §94 גמול חינוך לסגני מנהלים ראשונים: from
-- תשס"ט, a first deputy under the reform who is a homeroom teacher gets
-- §39's homeroom allowance on his combined salary (after the conversion,
-- for an existing one); and no other role allowance.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-39`
§ `94 גמול חינוך לסגני מנהלים ראשונים`

-- "גמול למחנך כיתה … כמפורט בסעיף 39 לעיל": the allowance at the rate §39
-- gives the class he educates, 11.5% for a first grade (§39(א)(2)) and 10%
-- for any other (§39(א)(1)).
@ref akn:art_94 akn:art_94/p2
GIVEN `a homeroom teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `of a first grade` IS A BOOLEAN, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `year starts` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's role allowances` `a homeroom teacher` `of a first grade` `combined salary` `year starts` IS
    IF `a homeroom teacher` AND `year starts` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008)
    THEN `the role rate` `the deputy's homeroom role` TIMES `combined salary`
    ELSE 0
    WHERE
        `the deputy's homeroom role` MEANS
            IF `of a first grade` THEN `homeroom teacher of a first grade` ELSE `homeroom teacher`

#ASSERT `a first deputy's role allowances` TRUE FALSE 12000 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008) EQUALS 1200
#ASSERT `a first deputy's role allowances` TRUE TRUE 12000 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008) EQUALS 1380
#ASSERT `a first deputy's role allowances` FALSE TRUE 12000 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008) EQUALS 0

-- The ministry's salary simulator (educalc, Ofek Nihul, salary month
-- 2026-09) pays a first deputy on a combined salary of 12,987 who educates
-- a first grade 1,298.70 (line 108 at 10%), the rate of any other class;
-- §94 with §39(א)(2) gives 11.5%, 1,493.51 (F-ofek-hadash-base-94-a).
`a first deputy educating a first grade is owed 11.5%, not the simulator's 10%` MEANS
        `a first deputy's role allowances` TRUE TRUE 12987 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2026) EQUALS 12987 TIMES (11.5%)
    AND `to the agora` (12987 TIMES (11.5%)) EQUALS 1493.51
    AND 12987 TIMES (10%) EQUALS 1298.70
#ASSERT `a first deputy educating a first grade is owed 11.5%, not the simulator's 10%`
